   "sourceHash": "d019d71f108a15e9229f6d7c5eff6e1de492584438e896c59525762b860fb5c0",
   "text": "致力于可持续发展",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20dcc0492e5fed29df95",
   "sourceHash": "20dcc0492e5fed29df95710c33770cff9c775ae0a282db9c0f922d706746beff",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 以环保的做法而闻名。园区基础设施采用环保材料和节能技术，尊重自然环境。凭借这些努力，Kairali 在环境保护和推动负责任旅游方面获得了认可。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'The infrastructure of the retreat' rendered as 园区基础设施 to avoid retreat/resort framing."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7849c58f47e4cb4e75be",
   "sourceHash": "7849c58f47e4cb4e75beb1116ed615c55956f541163c4bc169954e617b9f668c",
   "text": "深受全球客户与从业者信赖",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a07e7140f0f03dd7898a",
   "sourceHash": "a07e7140f0f03dd7898ab21fc580e48561820b6787eca3eea8997910d9eaef45",
   "text": "这些认证和荣誉不仅提升了 Kairali 的声誉，也让到访者更加安心信赖。Kairali 以其卓越的品质和正宗性而闻名，是健康爱好者、阿育吠陀从业者和国际访客信赖的选择。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'international tourists' rendered as 国际访客 (visitor) for the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e3c288c4243245ffe142",
   "sourceHash": "e3c288c4243245ffe142ca5b1f960355acfa8fc788e06667a2dc5e435aa3b162",
